      "benchmark_family": "GR-Evolve router code-evolution method",
      "name": "GR-Evolve / design-adaptive global-router source evolution",
      "category": "后端/全局路由器算法代码进化agent",
      "artifact_type": "复用ORFS设计的source-evolution方法协议；非45独立bench",
      "task_layer": "固定placement+netlist/PDK→改routerC++→GR/DR反馈",
      "version": "arXiv2604.22234v1；root5223e79；4evolved分支HEAD另固定",
      "input": "7设计AES/IBEX/JPEG/SWERV/DYNAMIC_NODE/ARIANE136/BLACK_PARROT，15design-platform：Nangate45七/ASAP7五/SKY130HD三，每组FastRoute/CUGR/SPRoute=45实验。输入placedDEF/LEF/原netlist、router源码、summary和先前QoR/gitlogs，不改placement/netlist。",
      "task": "每freshagent session读外部context，修改NEWGR算法/启发式/控制流与必要buildfiles，compile→route→record/commit；错误可同iter自修，跨designwarmstart。区别于只调router超参数或生成netlist。",
      "output": "design专用router代码/commit和GR/DRQoR；bestmutation事后选择，保留tradeoff。",
      "metrics": "soft priority：DRwirelengthμm→DRvia count→GRruntime秒；DRruntime另报。TWL作者定义WL+VC为自定proxy，不当物理总线长；SKY130表4处TWLΔ不能由同表WL/VCΔ复算（最大约5.96pp），保留冲突。最终选中router作者称DRCclean/LVS，未每轮都硬验。",
      "baseline": "未修改三router同placement；75mutationiter小设计约24h，大设计warmstart25或更少约12–18h。EPYC7313双socket/512GB，Codex5.3medium；GRruntime不含进化12–24h，iter也非固定LLM/call次数，费用未完整给。部分WL/VC/runtime互相恶化，不将selectedWL增益称全PPA普升。",
      "tools_and_access": "42selectedrootGitblob匹配；公开AGENTS/脚本、sourcefork分支和27sheet摘要。完整tree无README所指Dockerfile，gitlinkrouter固定点是upstreammerge并非45score对应evolved版本；逐选择SHA/placement/PDK/binary和原log仍缺。root无LICENSE，OpenROAD/ORFS/router/PDK分开审。",
      "limitations": "prompt可改面有NEWGR-only与末尾整个OpenROAD目录两层描述，runner未显式固定权限sandbox；静态不证明已隔离作弊。最终DRC/LVS不代表所有迭代及timing/power/IR签核；paperTWL冲突、selectedQoR、失败分母和同预算nativeparamsearch待复核。",
      "industrial_value": "研究判断：EDA内部算法仍可由agent定制，不把原生router拥有功能等同工程优化已解决；模型价值须计进化成本、保持验证独立并对强原生/调参基线比较。",
